  "problemDescription": "Multi-mode 4-bit shift register. On rising clk: if se(0)='0' shift right (Qt <= Dl & Qt(3 downto 1)); elsif se(1)='1' shift left (Qt <= Qt(2 downto 0) & Dr); else parallel load Qt<=D. Output Q = Qt.",
  "ports": [
